        "identifier": "https://github.com/TauCetiProject/TauCeti/tree/83769e442d55cda9d85b3927a93b286831c595ff",
        "note": "Imported as a dependency. Used: η(−1/z)² = −iz·η(z)², level raising of cusp forms, conjugation of Γ₀(11) by diag(11,1), the Sturm bound for finite-index subgroups, the decomposition of the norm to level one at the cusp, the index of Γ₀(p), the Hecke operators on S_k(N,χ) with their coefficient formula, and the identification of the trivial-character space with S_k(Γ₀(N)). New here: the multiplier of η² on SL(2,ℤ), the Γ₀(11)-invariance and cuspidality of η(z)²η(11z)², the vanishing criterion for cusp forms of weight 2 and level 11, dimension one, the eigenform relations and integrality. A search of this TauCeti commit and its Mathlib on 10 November 2026 found no eta quotient proved modular at a level above one, no transformation law for η under a general element of SL(2,ℤ), and no explicit newform of level above one.",
